SUMMARY:🚆 Book DB ICE 123: Amsterdam ➔ Cologne (Super Sparpreis Release)
DESCRIPTION:Trip Day 5 (19 Dec 2026): Deutsche Bahn Winter Timetable Sales Drop!\n\nBook DB ICE 123 (08:38 Amsterdam Centraal ➔ 11:15 Köln Hbf) the moment sales open to lock in €19.90 – €29.90 Super Sparpreis Europa fares.\n\nAdd €5.50 seat reservation to guarantee you sit together with luggage space during the peak Christmas market rush.\n\nBooking Link: https://int.bahn.de or DB Navigator App
URL:https://int.bahn.de
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Reminder: Book DB ICE 123 on int.bahn.de (Super Sparpreis Release)
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

